{"id":"9c84d18273410b84","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-soundness-modal.md","title":"Modal Soundness","display":"df-soundness-modal — Modal Soundness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-soundness-modal","aliases":["89-df-soundness-modal"],"display":"df-soundness-modal — Modal Soundness","depends_on":["[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-soundness-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-soundness-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-soundness-modal — Modal Soundness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{C}\">\\(\\mathcal{C}\\)</span> is a set of Kripke frames.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(L,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(L,\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元模态可靠性谓词，参数依次为逻辑公式集与框架集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(L,\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\in L\\to\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\mathcal C\\;(\\mathcal F\\models A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(L,\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\in L\\to\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\mathcal C\\;(\\mathcal F\\models A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(L, \\mathcal{C})\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(L, \\mathcal{C})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>对框架类<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{C}\">\\(\\mathcal{C}\\)</span>可靠</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>, 则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{C}\">\\(\\mathcal{C}\\)</span>的所有框架上有效</li>\n<li>GL对逆良基传递框架可靠</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(L,\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(L,\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\in L\\to\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\mathcal C\\;(\\mathcal F\\models A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(L, \\mathcal{C})","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{C}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{C}","display":false}],"bytes":1000,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-367","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-soundness-modal]]"}],"outgoing":["dbba58e7bd3b0667","bdef52f3ff411531"]}